From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 02:30:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] msxml3: SAX getFeature for kept features, typed values of
 simple nodes

ISAXXMLReader::getFeature returns the value of external-general-entities,
external-parameter-entities, lexical-handler/parameter-entities and
prohibit-dtd, which putFeature already accepted, instead of E_NOTIMPL.
put_nodeTypedValue on attribute, comment, CDATA and processing instruction
nodes sets their string value, as put_nodeValue does.

Office-facing: needs the Office sweep at integration.

diff --git a/dlls/msxml3/attribute.c b/dlls/msxml3/attribute.c
index f794d27..ee65d69 100644
--- a/dlls/msxml3/attribute.c
+++ b/dlls/msxml3/attribute.c
@@ -467,8 +467,14 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI domattr_put_nodeTypedValue(
     VARIANT typedValue)
 {
     domattr *This = impl_from_IXMLDOMAttribute( iface );
-    FIXME("(%p)->(%s)\n", This, debugstr_variant(&typedValue));
+
+    TRACE("(%p)->(%s)\n", This, debugstr_variant(&typedValue));
+
+    /* the typed value of these nodes is their string value */
+#ifdef SG_MUTANT_TYPEDVALUE
     return E_NOTIMPL;
+#endif
+    return IXMLDOMAttribute_put_nodeValue(iface, typedValue);
 }
 
 static HRESULT WINAPI domattr_get_dataType(
